[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10561.51, "timestamp": "02:56:01", "text": "还剩10秒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10564.63, "timestamp": "02:56:04", "text": "计划。计划。计划。计划。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10565.63, "timestamp": "02:56:05", "text": "得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10597.67, "timestamp": "02:56:37", "text": "它。哦，那真是太让人紧张了。那个东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10603.11, "timestamp": "02:56:43", "text": "对吧，我更喜欢刷屏而不是射击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10606.07, "timestamp": "02:56:46", "text": "像这样。就像我那样发送垃圾邮件。那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10609.07, "timestamp": "02:56:49", "text": "事物。我按下了保持键。那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10611.429, "timestamp": "02:56:51", "text": "每次都会出现这个问题。我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10613.269, "timestamp": "02:56:53", "text": "遗忘。对于 Vandal 来说，你只需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10616.63, "timestamp": "02:56:56", "text": "先放出三颗子弹，然后嗯，是的。"}]